{"version":1,"content":"<p>新加坡能源市場管理局（EMA）周一（26日）宣布，初步勘探估算顯示，新加坡地底深處蘊藏的豐富地熱資源，技術潛力超過全國每年60太瓦時（TWh）用電量的60倍，當局將於今年底展開下一階段研究，進一步評估利用地熱能發電、製冷和供暖的可行性。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:30.343960+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:25:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.243840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602118+00:00","content_hash":"1c2c656623263893ab78972ec17760945e0f404d0a0f78b724e6d47a3bcb8d77","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}